{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001768267","cik":"0001768267","slug":"cerence-768267","name":"Cerence Inc.","ticker":"CRNC","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Services-Prepackaged Software","sic":"7372","country":"MA","website":"","listed_years":6.6,"first_annual":"2019-12-19","last_filing":"2026-07-02","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001768267&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Cerence Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Prepackaged Software\", based in MA, and has been publicly reporting for 7 years.","It reported $319.5m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, down 17.7% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 73.7%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($42.2m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Gross margin of 73.7% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1768267/000162828026032139/0001628280-26-032139-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-032139"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $42.2m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1768267/000162828026005569/0001628280-26-005569-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-005569"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-9.0% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1768267/000162828026032139/0001628280-26-032139-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-032139"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 17.7% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1768267/000162828026032139/0001628280-26-032139-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-032139"},{"text":"Growth is erratic - a standard deviation of 53.7% across 8 comparisons. Lumpy revenue usually means few customers or long contracts, and both make any single quarter a poor guide.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1768267/000162828026032139/0001628280-26-032139-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-032139"},{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 77.1% to 73.7% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1768267/000162828026032139/0001628280-26-032139-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-032139"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-3.8% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1768267/000162828026032139/0001628280-26-032139-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-032139"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $19.8m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1768267/000162828026032139/0001628280-26-032139-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-032139"},{"text":"Debt of $172.7m against equity of $158.5m. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1768267/000162828026032139/0001628280-26-032139-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-032139"},{"text":"No officer history could be reconstructed from public filings, so the team - the thing that matters most - is the thing we know least about.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001768267"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over the